   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2019-03-27",
   "text": "Reward Work Act \n This bill prohibits issuers from purchasing their own securities on a national exchange. The bill also requires one-third of an issuer's board of directors to be elected by employees in order for the issuer to be allowed to register securities."
  }
